tasks.description:
创建 Note 数据库模型用于存储笔记信息。在 app/models/ 目录下创建 note.py 文件，定义字段: id (主键), title (字符串), content (文本), created_at (时间戳), updated_at (时间戳)。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

创建数据库迁移文件以初始化笔记表。在 migrations/ 目录下创建迁移脚本，确保 Note 模型字段正确映射到数据库。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

实现笔记的 CRUD API 路由。在 app/routes/ 目录下创建 notes.py 文件，定义增删改查接口，调用 Note 模型进行数据库操作。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

创建笔记管理的前端页面。在 templates/ 目录下创建 notes.html 文件，包含笔记的创建表单、笔记列表展示，以及编辑和删除功能的按钮。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在后端实现搜索功能，支持通过标题或内容关键字搜索笔记。在 app/routes/notes.py 中添加搜索接口，并在前端 notes.html 中添加搜索输入框。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}
- GET /notes/search (request: {query: str}) -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
